\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHASyncWait.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyHASyncWait.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyMoveFrozenTarget = FALSE
    BuggyAckWrongTimeline = FALSE
    BuggyAckBelowTarget = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    FrozenTargetDoesNotMove
    AckMatchesFrozenTimeline
    AckSatisfiesFrozenLsn
    AckComesFromMatchingSlot
    AckSlotAppliedEnough
    Safety

==== BadBelowTargetAck
\* Expected-failure config: a standby ack below the frozen LSN satisfies the
\* sync wait.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.
\* AckSlotAppliedEnough is intentionally coupled (same ack-evidence step).

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyMoveFrozenTarget = FALSE
    BuggyAckWrongTimeline = FALSE
    BuggyAckBelowTarget = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    AckSatisfiesFrozenLsn

==== BadMoveTarget
\* Expected-failure config: promotion mutates an already frozen sync-wait
\* target to the new timeline.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyMoveFrozenTarget = TRUE
    BuggyAckWrongTimeline = FALSE
    BuggyAckBelowTarget = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    FrozenTargetDoesNotMove

==== BadWrongTimelineAck
\* Expected-failure config: a standby ack from the wrong timeline satisfies a
\* frozen sync-wait target.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.
\* AckComesFromMatchingSlot is intentionally coupled (same ack-evidence step).

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyMoveFrozenTarget = FALSE
    BuggyAckWrongTimeline = TRUE
    BuggyAckBelowTarget = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    AckMatchesFrozenTimeline
